Note: `FeaturePanel` uses `...this.state` to inherit from `BaseComponent`, but we only extract the explicitly declared keys in FeaturePanel's own constructor (`panelOpen`, `activeFeature`). The inherited `initialized` is extracted under `BaseComponent`.

